{"unit_id":"msz-legend__dsh-mobile-bridge#card-zh","repo":"msz-legend/dsh-mobile-bridge","commit":"b9d1b145b08d806722c3e137634eb5948b685ba0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Phone Mirror 是供手机浏览器使用的 DSH Desktop 远程接入插件。它通过边缘网关转发桌面 Web 界面，并把工具审批事件送到手机；会话、流式输出和桌面界面由原有 Web UI 提供。用户可用绑定密码登记设备，管理已绑定设备，在手机上处理工具审批，并选择 Cloudflare 或 SakuraFrp 等隧道接入。插件还可将任务结束状态发送到可配置的推送通道，适合需要离开电脑时继续查看和操作 DSH 会话的用户。需要 DSH Desktop、Node.js 22 或更高版本；远程隧道和通知通道按需配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4-8","index.js:193-230","index.js:241-259","lib/routes.js:303-345"]}
{"unit_id":"msz-legend__dsh-mobile-bridge#card-en","repo":"msz-legend/dsh-mobile-bridge","commit":"b9d1b145b08d806722c3e137634eb5948b685ba0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Phone Mirror connects a phone browser to DSH Desktop through an edge gateway and its existing web UI. It supports password pairing, mobile tool approvals, device management, optional tunnels, and task notifications. Requires DSH Desktop and Node.js 22 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4-8","index.js:193-230","index.js:241-259","lib/routes.js:303-345"]}
